      "label": "Melee (Hallowfell)",
      "notes": "The same general idea of maximizing strength and accuracy bonuses or prayer bonus to reduce Prayer point drain holds true from single target melee tasks\n\nHallowfell offers a strong melee option for tasks that would traditionally be done with bursting/barraging such as jellies or dust devils\n\nDinh's bulwark is useful to draw aggression, however this can also be achieved with the use of a goading potion, darts, or knives, freeing up special attack energy to be used for a weapon like the crystal halberd which can hit multiple targets. Alternatively, players can use Saradomin godsword or Ancient mace to restore Prayer points during a task.",
      "runePouch": []
    },
